   "body_md": "The Kingdom of Testmark rules the [[test-vale|Test Vale]] from [[lampton]]. It fought the [[eastmarch|Eastmarch]] in the [[war-of-the-ford|War of the Ford]].",
   "html": "<p>The Kingdom of Testmark rules the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/test-vale\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000030\" data-slug=\"test-vale\">Test Vale</a> from <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/lampton\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031\" data-slug=\"lampton\">Lampton</a>. It fought the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/eastmarch\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000012\" data-slug=\"eastmarch\">Eastmarch</a> in the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/war-of-the-ford\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000041\" data-slug=\"war-of-the-ford\">War of the Ford</a>.</p>\n"
